t-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"3. Data Retention Periods\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"We only keep personal data for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected, or as required or permitted by law.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Account & Identity Data:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Retained for the duration of your active subscription or contract, plus a standard 30-day grace period following account deletion, after which it is permanently purged from our primary database.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Security Telemetry (IP Logs):\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Directed to automated deletion sinks within our Google Cloud Platform (GCP) infrastructure and permanently erased after 30 days.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Workspace Content:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Dictated entirely by the enterprise customer's retention policies and DPA. When a corporate customer terminates their contract, all associated workspace payload data is securely wiped according to their specific instructions.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Statutory Exceptions to Deletion:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" If you have processed payments on our platform, financial transaction data and associated billing logs cannot be deleted immediately upon account closure due to statutory financial, tax, and anti-money laundering reporting obligations. Upon an erasure request, your profile link will be permanently anonymized, but core ledger records will be securely retained for the legally mandated statutory period under GDPR Art. 17(3)(b).\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"section\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"4. Outside Contractors & Sub-processors\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Pyngyn does not sell your personal data. We employ independent contractors, vendors, and infrastructure partners (collectively, “Outside Contractors”) to provide specific services related to the Pyngyn Service, such as hosting, payment processing, and AI-assisted features. We only share data with trusted sub-processors required to deliver our service and securely operate our platform:\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Cloud Infrastructure:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Google Cloud Platform (GCP) is utilized for hosting our application, maintaining our multi-tenant PostgreSQL databases, and securely encrypting cloud storage buckets.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Identity & Authentication:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Clerk (account sign-up, login, session management, and single sign-on for app.pyngyn.ai).\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Payment Processing:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Razorpay (processing transaction metadata, invoicing, and billing under PCI-DSS compliance).\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"AI Processing:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Anthropic (transient processing of text inputs entered into our free AI dashboard tools; no persistent data storage).\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Scheduling:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Calendly (managing public demo bookings, organizer notifications, names, and emails).\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Analytics & Marketing:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Google LLC (GA4) and Meta Platforms, Inc. (Meta Pixel) for user behavioral tracking upon explicit consent.\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"We require that these Outside Contractors agree to (1) protect the privacy of your personally identifiable information consistent with this Privacy Policy, and (2) not use or disclose your personally identifiable information for any purpose other than providing us with the products or services for which we contracted, or as required by law. All sub-processors are bound by strict confidentiality obligations and GDPR/DPDP-compliant data processing agreements. See our full \"}],\"$L2b\",\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\"]}]]}]]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"section\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"5. Your Data Privacy Rights\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Depending on your region, you have the following rights regarding your personal data:\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"