lemetry (IP Logs):\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Directed to automated deletion sinks within our Google Cloud Platform (GCP) infrastructure and permanently erased after 30 days.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Workspace Content:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" Dictated entirely by the enterprise customer's retention policies and DPA. When a corporate customer terminates their contract, all associated workspace payload data is securely wiped according to their specific instructions.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Statutory Exceptions to Deletion:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" If you have processed payments on our platform, financial transaction data and associated billing logs cannot be deleted immediately upon account closure due to statutory financial, tax, and anti-money laundering reporting obligations. Upon an erasure request, your profile link will be permanently anonymized, but core ledger records will be securely retained for the legally mandated statutory period under GDPR Art. 17(3)(b).\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"4. Outside Contractors & Sub-processors\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"